1
00:00:00,922 --> 00:00:03,842
(Awkward guy:)But how did you get her
to go out with you?

2
00:00:03,841 --> 00:00:05,591
(Leonard:)Well, she moved in
across the hall.

3
00:00:05,593 --> 00:00:07,473
(Penny:)And he started
to slowly wear me down.

4
00:00:07,478 --> 00:00:09,228
Mm-hmm.

5
00:00:09,230 --> 00:00:11,850
(Leonard:)Like a river carves a canyon.

6
00:00:11,849 --> 00:00:15,649
(Penny:)Yeah, except the river kept
showing me his Pokémon cards.

7
00:00:16,654 --> 00:00:18,154
(Red-haired guy:)Ready to go?

8
00:00:18,156 --> 00:00:19,356
(Awkward guy:)Hang on.
This guy's telling me

9
00:00:19,357 --> 00:00:21,607
(Awkward guy:)how he got the Serial Ape-ist
girl to marry him.

10
00:00:21,609 --> 00:00:23,189
(Red-haired guy:)This guy?

11
00:00:23,995 --> 00:00:27,115
(Red-haired guy:)But he's wearing
a change maker.

12
00:00:27,949 --> 00:00:30,329
(Penny:)I think it's hot.

13
00:00:31,335 --> 00:00:32,615
(Leonard:)That's right.

14
00:00:32,620 --> 00:00:34,670
(Leonard:)I'm her change daddy.

15
00:00:40,795 --> 00:00:42,465
(Howard:)What was I thinking?

16
00:00:42,463 --> 00:00:44,963
(Howard:)Wolowitzes are not
a lifting people!

17
00:00:44,966 --> 00:00:46,766
We tip the lifting people!

18
00:00:47,969 --> 00:00:50,689
(Bernadette:)Do we really
have to sit for hours

19
00:00:50,688 --> 00:00:51,888
(Bernadette:)in the emergency room?

20
00:00:51,889 --> 00:00:53,609
(Bernadette:)They're just gonna give you
ice and Advil

21
00:00:53,608 --> 00:00:55,228
(Bernadette:)like last time.

22
00:00:55,226 --> 00:00:57,476
(Howard:)You're gonna feel terrible
when I'm in a wheelchair.

23
00:00:59,146 --> 00:01:01,476
(Howard:)Which, by the way,
would fit easily in the back

